Copyright 2026 SEOULTRA and PasteFilter contributors

This product includes detection logic derived from PasteGuard
(https://github.com/sgasser/pasteguard), Copyright 2026 Stefan Gasser,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Specifically, the deterministic entity detectors (email, IPv4/IPv6, IBAN,
credit card, VAT, phone) and the secrets ruleset in src/detectors.js are a
JavaScript port of PasteGuard's Python detector and secrets configuration.
The PasteGuard proxy/server code is NOT included; PasteFilter is an independent
browser extension that runs entirely on-device.

The name "PasteGuard" is used only for attribution. PasteFilter is not
affiliated with or endorsed by the PasteGuard project.
